flowchart TD
    A[Start Script] --> B[Main Entry]
    B --> C[Run main once]
    C --> D[Start Daily Scheduler]

    %% =========================
    %% Scheduler
    %% =========================
    D --> E[Scheduler Loop]
    E -->|Daily 20:00| F[Run Scheduled Task]
    F --> G[Execute Main Async]
    G --> H[Scrape Finished]
    H --> E

    %% =========================
    %% Main Async Flow
    %% =========================
    C --> M[Initialize Main]
    M --> M1[Create Data Directory]
    M1 --> M2[Launch Browser]
    M2 --> M3[Open Setup Page]
    M3 --> M4[Get All Companies]
    M4 --> M5[Fill Async Queue]
    M5 --> M6[Open Global CSV]
    M6 --> M7[Create Workers]
    M7 --> M8[Wait For Workers]
    M8 --> M9[Close Browser]
    M9 --> M10[End Main]

    %% =========================
    %% Worker Logic
    %% =========================
    subgraph Worker_Process [Concurrent Workers]
        W1[Create Browser Context]
        W1 --> W2[Block Static Resources]
        W2 --> W3[Open Page]
        W3 --> W4{Queue Empty}
        W4 -->|No| W5[Get Company]
        W5 --> W6[Read Last Local Row]
        W6 --> W7[Retry Loop]

        W7 --> W8[Load Instruments Page]
        W8 --> W9[Select Company]
        W9 --> W10[Apply Filters]
        W10 --> W11[Read First Web Row]
        W11 --> W12{Same As Local}

        W12 -->|Yes| W13[Skip Company]
        W13 --> W4

        W12 -->|No| W14[Prepare CSV Files]
        W14 --> W15[Pagination Loop]
        W15 --> W16[Extract Rows]
        W16 --> W17{Row Already Exists}
        W17 -->|Yes| W18[Stop Pagination]
        W17 -->|No| W19[Write Company CSV]
        W19 --> W20[Write Global CSV]
        W20 --> W15

        W18 --> W21[Mark Success]
        W21 --> W4

        W7 -->|Error| W22[Wait And Retry]
        W22 --> W7

        W7 -->|Max Retries| W23[Mark Failed]
        W23 --> W4

        W4 -->|Yes| W24[Close Context]
    end
